#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Curriculum"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "What is taught: programmes, grades, subjects and the classes they are taught in."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Programme**: A coherent course of education at an institution, mapped to a level of the international classification of education. _Avoid_: Course, track, stream"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Grade**: A stage within a programme that a learner normally completes in one academic year. _Avoid_: Year group, standard, class"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Subject**: A field of study taught as a unit within a programme. _Avoid_: Course (unless it is a course offering)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/curriculum/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Class**: A group of learners taught together in an academic period, which may span grades. _Avoid_: Section, homeroom"
msgstr ""
